            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "About the suggested workaround above - it looks too broad, ENOENT for a child when watching a directory will stop the whole directory watcher. If pursuing the workaround approach, that should probably be narrowed down to file watchers only, and on Windows only.\n\nAttaching gpt-6-astra analysis of the situation, seems to contain useful tips: [astra-autoread-analysis.md](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/34187958/astra-autoread-analysis.md)",
